<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-HAMBURGER WINS SEVENTH CATALONIA STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-HAMBURGER WINS SEVENTH CATALONIA STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>PAL, Andorra 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bo Hamburger of the Netherlands won the seventh stage of the Tour of Catalonia over 237 kms from Gerona on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Fernando Escartin of Spain took over as race leader.</p>
</text>
